  "interpretation": "Uses the existing Tree/TreeEval/Eval/PartialFold semantics. The evaluator handles every finite tree; one-hole and closed trees are subcases, and holes counts the cancelled example. Domain is existence of an ordinary evaluation; value is a dependent semantic map. Its noncomputable choice does not enter compute. Structural recursion needs a supplied DecidableEq; rationalField instantiates every FieldData law using Lean 4.24.0 standard Rat lemmas. No arbitrary-field zero decision is assumed.",
